{#- Day 1 after the due date. -#}
{% extends "email/base.j2" %}
{% block subject %}Payment reminder — Invoice {{ invoice_number }}{% endblock %}
{% block content %}Dear {{ contact_name | default(customer_name, true) }},

This is a friendly reminder that invoice {{ invoice_number }}, dated
{{ invoice_date }}, fell due on {{ due_date }}. The outstanding balance
is {{ balance }}.

If payment is already on its way, please ignore this note — and thank you.
Otherwise, we would appreciate payment at your earliest convenience. If
anything about this invoice needs clarification, just reply to this email.{% endblock %}
